                ],
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 8.3,
                "security-severity": "8.3"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHETOMCATEMBED-15990633",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "High severity - HTTP Request Smuggling vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-24880) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to HTTP Request Smuggling in `ChunkedInputFilter`, when handling HTTP/1.1 requests with invalid chunk extensions. An attacker can interfere with the interpretation of HTTP requests and responses by injecting CRLF sequences and sending the payload to an application using a reverse proxy that allows those sequences.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.116, 10.1.53, 11.0.20 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Mailing List](https://lists.apache.org/thread/2c682qnlg2tv4o5knlggqbl9yc2gb5sn)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/2cb06c34f661ca42f7570bbcc21e99806184bcc5)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/fde1a8235fb73125217bd41e162aa0a113f33552)\n- [OSS Security Advisory](http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/09/20)\n"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "CWE-444",
                  "maven"
                ],
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 8.2,
                "security-severity": "8.2"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHETOMCATEMBED-15990787",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Medium severity - Open Redirect vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-25854) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Open Redirect via the `LoadBalancerDrainingValve.invoke()` function. When the `LoadBalancerDrainingValve` is in the disabled (draining) state, an attacker can redirect users to a malicious attacker-controlled URL.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.116, 10.1.53, 11.0.20 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Mailing List](https://lists.apache.org/thread/ghct3b6o74bp2vm7q875s1zh0dqrz3h0)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/4c5d306001b780c9316aea5ff6502c524fb20695)\n- [OSS Security Advisory](http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/09/21)\n"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "CWE-601",
                  "maven"
                ],
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 5.1,
                "security-severity": "5.1"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHETOMCATEMBED-16643259",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "High severity - Allocation of Resources Without Limits or Throttling vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-41284) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Allocation of Resources Without Limits or Throttling via the WebDAV `LOCK` and `PROPFIND` XML request bodies. An attacker can cause excessive resource consumption by sending specially crafted requests that trigger unbounded reads.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.118, 10.1.55, 11.0.22 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Mailing List](https://lists.apache.org/thread/2nvqjr7ovjmvx2vbhb7s61ycd5msc8qc)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/7fd8c2845e38cf7745fb5c15c81806807f39ea39)\n"
              },
