              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Critical severity - Improper Authentication vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-43512) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Improper Authentication when DIGEST authentication is configured. An attacker can gain unauthorized access by providing any unknown username, as the system will incorrectly authenticate the user.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.118, 10.1.55, 11.0.22 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Mailing List](https://lists.apache.org/thread/7x09x7o12solvclslw3sz0288xc8wx73)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/6565a6cb6499e56fe2f34457cec99f9d1c4f39e9)\n"
