            },
            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHETOMCATEMBED-21715433",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Medium severity - HTTP Request Smuggling vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-77756) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to HTTP Request Smuggling via the `Http11Processor` in the HTTP/1.x request-processing component. An attacker can cause one request from another user to fail by sending an HTTP/1.0 request with a `Transfer-Encoding` header when Tomcat is behind a reverse proxy that interprets the request differently.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.122, 10.1.60, 11.0.26 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Security Advisory](https://lists.apache.org/thread/bl5b6rxqh3vb2k9bj2794vhor7o6xl3z)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/9c91bba7a4f4270453f70b9f2cadaca5fc992f89)\n- [GitHub Commit 10.1.60](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/bf44bee23d97fbb1a64cbbbb213ff2b6506d26c4)\n- [GitHub Commit 11.0.26](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/1ad63de866a6e7007304ebe5165f72e65ece32b6)\n- [GitHub Commit 9.0.122](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/e590588ab7649c93d49b0eb7b3152700a977880d)\n"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
