            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHETOMCATEMBED-21715436",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "High severity - Allocation of Resources Without Limits or Throttling vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-78383) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Allocation of Resources Without Limits or Throttling via the `AjpProcessor` in the AJP connector. An unauthenticated attacker can pin an AJP processing thread and cause denial of service by triggering an error response for an AJP request that declares or expects a body but does not provide it; while finishing the response, the processor waits to consume the unread body.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.122, 10.1.59, 11.0.26 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Security Advisory](https://lists.apache.org/thread/tyqcqk99g7ghgk22641vf67vghcyswnw)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/9979b6b5170733ed53de3602a7cfadd35366a63b)\n- [GitHub Commit 10.1.60](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/2ed6d18ebfe4b085ef050dd0a0f4f20aff3bc48d)\n- [GitHub Commit 11.0.26](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/6dabd4303095785183ede57f6d162c542955a5a8)\n- [GitHub Commit 9.0.122](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/265bdc0a58b1447ff5d8f8b96ea81de58cb74c8c)\n"
              },
