            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHETOMCATEMBED-21716513",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Medium severity - Incorrect Synchronization vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-77762) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Incorrect Synchronization via the shared header emitter in the HTTP/2 `HpackDecoder`. An attacker can inject trailer fields into another HTTP/2 request by sending requests that cause a stream to be reset and replaced while headers are being decoded, making the server process the other request with attacker-supplied trailer data.\n\n**Notes**\n\n- At the decoder-to-request handoff, the affected and attacker-controlled streams must be on the same HTTP/2 connection, whose `HpackDecoder` shares the header emitter.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.122, 10.1.60, 11.0.26 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Security Advisory](https://lists.apache.org/thread/y5r9fvjo7ol24mkoyoc0st8bqrfyqcyn)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/5ae8ae4825f16362ae7e4c1af120ac10117ee02b)\n- [GitHub Commit 10.1.60](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/77d2d59347891eced52b0cb5a979fc33a8a2620c)\n- [GitHub Commit 11.0.26](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/fd309997dfd0d351b26959a8afd7bffec33dd0de)\n- [GitHub Commit 9.0.122](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/71f27c2e84810930beda468b5ba732dcd0ef2652)\n"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "CWE-362",
                  "CWE-821",
                  "maven"
                ],
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 6.3,
                "security-severity": "6.3"
              }
