            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHETOMCATEMBED-21716517",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Medium severity - Authentication Bypass by Primary Weakness vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-75973) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Authentication Bypass by Primary Weakness via the `getServerAuthConfig` method in `SimpleAuthConfigProvider`. When Jakarta Authentication uses this provider as the default for multiple web applications, its cached configuration retains the realm of the first application to authenticate a request. An attacker can send requests to another application and have them authenticated against that first realm, potentially gaining access to resources protected by the other application’s intended authentication.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.122, 10.1.60, 11.0.26 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Security Advisory](https://lists.apache.org/thread/njjcdkkzqyzx4n3ffc4ffjmyh5mpl1gr)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/3a1c06bc349668e52e8f0eca66d4469ff71fae8d)\n- [GitHub Commit 10.1.60](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/f62c65768fdaa300e22e64ffa7b5118dce0571a1)\n- [GitHub Commit 11.0.26](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/2585fc798f24f0b8811fd20ad9b4e8affb6f69a6)\n- [GitHub Commit 9.0.122](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/043115414a39127cad015e9d285296e59c18bb41)\n"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "CWE-287",
                  "CWE-305",
                  "maven"
                ],
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 6.3,
                "security-severity": "6.3"
              }
